<worksheet>
    <title>
         Laplace transform for Dirac Delta function
    </title>

    <objectives>
        <ul>
            
            <li>
                <p>
                    Using Laplace transform to solve differential equations with Dirac Delta functions.
                </p>
            </li>

   
        </ul>
    </objectives>
<introduction>
        <p>
            We have been exploring the Laplace transform for some special functions and how to use it in solving differential equations. Here is a recap of what we learned so far:

        </p>
       
               
        
